-      "original_required_outcome": "- A mission charter stating purpose, intended beneficiaries, affected parties, time horizon, and final decision owner.\n- A mission problem statement and theory of change grounded in evidence rather than rhetoric.\n- Explicit values, invariants, non-goals, prohibited means, and unacceptable harms.\n- Decision principles for resolving recurring tradeoffs without inventing hidden priorities.\n- Outcome indicators, anti-metrics, failure indicators, and review triggers.\n- A map from mission to strategic capabilities, obligations, and downstream sections without preselecting implementation.\n- A drift and amendment process preserving historical rationale and human authority.",
