-      "original_required_outcome": "- A product strategy statement identifying intended users, owners, operators, affected parties, contexts, problems, and outcomes.\n- An evidence-backed value proposition and explicit product non-goals.\n- A prioritized capability model rather than an ungoverned feature list.\n- Product principles covering agency, trust, accessibility, privacy, safety, security, reliability, recovery, and human-AI interaction where applicable.\n- A product hypothesis and outcome framework with anti-metrics, risks, and evidence thresholds.\n- A staged product lifecycle and roadmap logic tied to learning, not arbitrary dates.\n- Build, buy, integrate, partner, hold, and retire decision boundaries.",
