n-to-policy, and domain-to-test traceability model.\n- A durable handoff to Business Architecture, Capability Architecture, Process Architecture, Functional Architecture, Operational Architecture, Information Architecture, Data Architecture, Application Architecture, Software Architecture, API Architecture, Event-Driven Architecture, AI Architecture, testing, operations, and lifecycle work.",
