, environmental, or assistive-technology differences affect outcome.","original_non_applicability":null,"requirement_ids":["REQ-09-01","REQ-09-02","REQ-09-03","REQ-09-04","REQ-10-01","REQ-10-02","REQ-10-03","REQ-10-04","REQ-13-01","REQ-13-02","REQ-13-03","REQ-13-04","REQ-13-05","REQ-24-01","REQ-24-02","REQ-24-03","REQ-24-04","REQ-24-05","REQ-29-01","REQ-29-02","REQ-29-03","REQ-30-01","REQ-30-02","REQ-30-03","REQ-30-04","REQ-32-01","REQ-32-02","REQ-32-03","REQ-32-04","REQ-33-01","REQ-33-02","REQ-33-03","REQ-34-01","REQ-34-02","REQ-34-03","REQ-34-04","REQ-35-01","REQ-35-02","REQ-35-03","REQ-36-01","REQ-36-02","REQ-36-03","REQ-36-04","REQ-37-01","REQ-37-02","REQ-37-03","REQ-37-04","REQ-38-01","REQ-38-02","REQ-38-03","REQ-38-04","REQ-38-05","REQ-40-01","REQ-40-02","REQ-40-03","REQ-41-01","REQ-41-02","REQ-41-03","REQ-41-04","REQ-42-01","REQ-42-02","REQ-42-03"],"decision_reason":"Complete 135-line original read. Users must be able to understand and operate the native application, memory, models, consent, authority, denial, cancellation, export and recovery through supported assistive and alternative interactions, including AI or network loss.","inspection_evidence_refs":["handoff/source_reconciliation_20261007_09.md"],"bounded_working_artifact_refs":["handoff/privacy_assurance_reconciliation_20261007_09.json"]},{"original_archive_path":"Thirstys Codex/03_SECTIONS/054_CONTENT_ARCHITECTURE.txt","path":"sources/codex/canonical_text/03_SECTIONS/054_CONTENT_ARCHITECTURE.txt","sha256":"df7611d0817b84023ef56bc0829a06235edf8d96e9cc464257adf8bb3015e0ad","bytes":7921,"section":"054","original_title":"SECTION 054 — Content Architecture","original_status":"CONTENT-COMPLETE","applicability":"DIRECT","implementation_status":"IN_PROGRESS","conformance_status":"NOT_EVALUATED","reconciliation_instruction":"Read original applicability/prerequisites and map its applicable clauses to exact CETA requirements before coding the affected work package.","volume":3,"volume_pdf":"sources/codex/Thirstys_Codex_Standards_Edition_Volume_03_Requirements_through_Hardware_Architecture.pdf","original_required_outcome":"- A content model with types, audiences, purposes, owners, sources, workflows, versions, rights, channels, evidence, and lifecycle.\n- Controlled authoring, review, publication, correction, withdrawal, localization, accessibility, and archival behavior.","original_applicability":"- Content is created, edited, generated, translated, published, rendered, retained, or retired for users, operators, systems, or records.\n- Meaning, rights, accessibility, truth, timing, or publication affects material outcomes.","original_non_applicability":null,"requirement_ids":["REQ-06-01","REQ-06-02","REQ-06-03","REQ-06-04","REQ-09-01","REQ-09-02","REQ-09-03","REQ-09-04","REQ-10-01","REQ-10-02","REQ-10-03","REQ-10-04","REQ-11-01","REQ-11-02","REQ-11-03","REQ-11-04","REQ-11-05","REQ-12-01","REQ-12-02","REQ-12-03","REQ-12-04","REQ-12-05","REQ-13-01","REQ-13-02","REQ-13-03","REQ-13-04","REQ-13-05","REQ-24-01","REQ-24-02","REQ-24-03","REQ-24-04","REQ-24-05","REQ-29-01","REQ-29-02","REQ-29-03","REQ-30-01","REQ-30-02","REQ-30-03","REQ-30-04","REQ-31-01","REQ-31-02","REQ-31-03","REQ-31-04","REQ-31-05","REQ-32-01","REQ-32-02","REQ-32-03","REQ-32-04","REQ-33-01","REQ-33-02","REQ-33-03","REQ-35-01","REQ-35-02","REQ-35-03","REQ-36-01","REQ-36-02","REQ-36-03","REQ-36-04","REQ-38-01","REQ-38-02","REQ-38-03","REQ-38-04","REQ-38-05","REQ-40-01","REQ-40-02","REQ-40-03","REQ-41-01","REQ-41-02","REQ-41-03","REQ-41-04","REQ-42-01","REQ-42-02","REQ-42-03"],"decision_reason":"Complete 134-line original read. CETA creates user-facing answers, explanations, documents, generated proposals, citations and evidence. Their source, audience, purpose, rights, versions, approval and correction matter independently of fluent wording or visual presentation.","inspection_evidence_refs":["handoff/source_reconciliation_20261007_09.md"],"bounded_working_artifact_refs":["handoff/privacy_assurance_reconciliat